<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<meta name="description" content="Remplacer électrique par PAC à Orsay 91 : économisez 150€/mois. Aides 10 800€. RGE gratuit 24h.">
<link rel="canonical" href="https://www.maprimeadapt-idf.fr/remplacer-electrique-pac-orsay-91">
<title>Remplacer électrique par PAC à Orsay 91 : économisez 150€/mois</title>
<style>
* { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f0f4f8 0%, #e8eef7 100%); color: #2c3e50; }
.container { max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 40px 20px; }
.hero { background: white; border-radius: 12px; padding: 50px 40px; box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); }
.hero h1 { font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; color: #1a3d2b; }
.section { background: white; border-radius: 12px; padding: 40px; box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); margin-bottom: 30px; }
.form { background: #1a3d2b; color: white; border-radius: 12px; padding: 40px; }
.form-group { margin-bottom: 15px; }
.form-group input { width: 100%; padding: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3); border-radius: 6px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); color: white; }
.btn-submit { width: 100%; padding: 12px; background: white; color: #1a3d2b; border: none; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container">
  <div class="hero">
    <h1>Remplacer électrique par PAC à Orsay 91 : économisez 150€/mois</h1>
    <p><strong>Orsay (91) électrique grille-pain ?</strong> PAC COP 3-4 = 280€/mois → 125€/mois. Économisez 155€/mois = 1860€/an. Aides 10 800€ cumulées.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="section">
    <h2>Électrique vs PAC Orsay 91</h2>
    <p><strong>Coût électrique :</strong> 280€/mois. <strong>Avec PAC :</strong> 125€/mois. <strong>Économie :</strong> 155€/mois = 1860€/an. COP 3-4 = 3-4× plus efficace que résistance.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="form">
    <h2>Devis PAC Orsay 91</h2>
    <form onsubmit="submitForm(event)">
      <div class="form-group"><label>Nom *</label><input type="text" name="nom" required></div>
      <div class="form-group"><label>Téléphone *</label><input type="tel" name="tel" placeholder="06 XX XX XX XX" required></div>
      <button type="submit" class="btn-submit">Devis (électrique→PAC)</button>
    </form>
  </div>
</div>
<script>
function submitForm(e) {
  e.preventDefault();
  fetch('/api/lead', { method: 'POST', headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' }, body: JSON.stringify({ nom: e.target.nom.value, tel: e.target.tel.value, source: 'remplacer-electrique-pac-orsay-91', commune: 'Orsay' }) }).then(r => r.json()).then(r => { if(r.ok) alert('Devis en 24-48h'); });
}
</script>
</body>
</html>
